    <statement><p>Find a vector equation with parameter <m>t</m> for the line through the point <m>(6,0,1)</m> and perpendicular to the plane <m>x+4 y +4 z =5.</m></p>
<p>Answer: <m>\mathbf{r}(t) =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;6,0,1\right&gt;+t\mathopen{}\left&lt;1,4,4\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
